I eat food.
Then I sit on the sofa.
I take my mobile phone.
I call my family in Mexico.
This is a video call.
My younger sister Sofia answers the phone.
She is playing with our dog Lola.
Lola is running in the room.
Sofia is laughing loudly.
I see them on the screen.
I smile happily.
"Chechi, are you well?" Sofia asks.
"I am fine," I say.
"Are you working now, Chechi?" she asks.
"No, I am resting," I say.
Then my mother comes into that room.
She is looking at the screen.
"Hello Maya," mother says.
I am very happy now.
